# Generated by hfs sync (profile be). Do not edit: run "npx hfs sync --write".
# Commit gate: the secrets guard and work hygiene of the staged files, types, lint and format of the staged files, the unit specs the staged files touch. Never integration, e2e or contract.
npx hfs work-hygiene
npm run typecheck
sources=$(git diff --cached --name-only --diff-filter=ACMR -- '*.ts' '*.mts' '*.cts' '*.js' '*.mjs' '*.cjs' || true)
if [ -n "$sources" ]; then
  npx eslint $sources
  npx prettier --check $sources
fi
specs=$(git diff --cached --name-only --diff-filter=ACMR -- '*.ts' | grep -v -E '(^|/)src/tests/(world|integration|e2e|contract)/|\.(integration|e2e|contract)-spec\.ts$' || true)
if [ -n "$specs" ]; then
  npm run test:affected -- --findRelatedTests $specs
fi
